//   T27OS_INSTALL=1    write ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ai.t27.os-server.plist for this binary: it starts
//                      the server at login, so panes come back (by session id, model kept) after a reboot.
//
// Every decision is a fn with a test that runs; the host loop only moves bytes through pty_sys.t27.
//
// Refs gHashTag/t27#10782.
